<section class="page">
    <h1 class="page-title">About Me</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
        Jay Bell — CTO &amp; Co-Founder of Trellis.org, Angular GDE, Nx Champion, podcaster.
    </p>

    <div class="prose-jay">
        <p>
            I'm the CTO and Co-Founder of
            <a href="https://trellis.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Trellis.org</a>, a social
            enterprise working to empower global collective impact. I've been steering Trellis's technical
            direction since its inception in 2018.
        </p>
        <p>
            Born and raised in Canada, I've dabbled in various entrepreneurial ventures, from drones to
            software and mobile apps. My passion for technology and innovation led me to co-found Trellis.org.
            I specialize in Nx, Angular, Nest, DevOps, CI/CD, startups, TypeScript, GraphQL, and NgRx — and
            I'm an active open-source contributor.
        </p>
    </div>

